  "body": "Kenya Aviation Workers Union members downed tools at the Kenya Airports Authority, KCAA and Jambojet on Sunday 30 August. Kenya Airways reported that only **30% of its scheduled flights had departed by 14:00 EAT**, with those that went averaging two-to-three-hour delays and later departures running beyond three (KQ customer update via KATA, 30 August). Disruption continued into this morning. KAA confirms delays but reports no closure — flights are operating.",
